              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Each dot is a user. The vertical axis is modeled value; the horizontal axis is observed consumption priced with the selected customer credit rate. Dots toward the top-left deliver more modeled value than they cost; dots toward the bottom-right cost more than they return. Color groups users by their value-vs-credit band. Use the flyout filters to focus on a department, license, or budget. Estimated Value $ is modeled from observed task counts using published time-per-task research benchmarks and the selected customer labor rate. Contracted Cost remains unavailable until observed consumption data and required customer billing inputs are connected.",
